{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13481","headline":"听筝 · 柳中庸","name":"听筝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"抽弦促柱听秦筝，无限秦人悲怨声。\n似逐春风知柳态，如随啼鸟识花情。\n谁家独夜愁灯影，何处空楼思月明。\n更入几重离别恨，江南歧路洛阳城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳中庸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13481.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13481","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}